      "content": "\n\n\n\n---\n\nProjects Table\n\n    - Active Inference — e.g. learning the math. \n\n      - Bringing up, I want to learn this math (e.g. Category Theory question) \n\nComing to switchpoint / waystation. Looking back on that. And forward to — collaborations on [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_subWlqVP](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_subWlqVP) \n\nOne idea is to make [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suV-LOe1](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suV-LOe1) more around tools. These practical topics will not effect all. \n\nWednesday for [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suV-LOe1](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suV-LOe1) . In the Sandbox. \n\n\n\nKnowledge Engineering & Foraging\n\nKnowledge Math \n\n[https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suTEdstt](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_suTEdstt) \n\n",
